 class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">丁々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">斧头砍下时的声音；锤桩入地时的沉闷声</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">盗難</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうなん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">盗窃；失窃</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124132\"><ruby>盗難<rp>(</rp><rt>とうなん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>届<rp>(</rp><rt>とどけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をだしたいのですけど。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I would like to report a theft.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">投入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">投入；插入；存入（如投票）；投资；投入（资金、人员等）；注入；灌输；推出；上市（产品）；引入；提交（作业至计算机）；下达（命令）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227774\">オーナーたちは<ruby>組合<rp>(</rp><rt>くみあい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のシンパを<ruby>一人残<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとりのこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らず<ruby>解雇<rp>(</rp><rt>かいこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するために<ruby>首切<rp>(</rp><rt>くびき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>投入<rp>(</rp><rt>とうにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The owners brought in a hatchet man to fire all the union sympathizers.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当人</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とうにん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N