ead\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠ざかる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおざかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">远去；渐远；逐渐消失；淡去；疏远；产生隔阂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103347\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>政治<rp>(</rp><rt>せいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>遠<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ざかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He distanced himself from politics.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">让通过；放行；让路；透（光、声音等）；导（电）；使渗透；通（风）；贯穿；透进；穿过（孔洞）；硬塞过去；穿（针）；插过；连接（两地）；开通（道路等）；建立联系；接通；延伸到；让（考生、申请者等）通过；录取；准许进入；把人领进（屋内、房间等）；引进；带入；让进；有条理地陈述；使论点站得住；（说理）前后一贯；坚持（原则）；经由（中间人）；以…为中介；借助（某物）进行；使（法案）通过；使（议案）获通过；为……让路；隔着（门、墙等）听；透过（窗户等）看；（烹饪）彻底加热；煮熟；热透；均匀受热；（烹饪）浸入（调味汁）；过一下（汤汁）；放入沸水中焯；使（他人）认可（计划等）；迫使同意；强行推进；坚持己见；继续保持；持续进行；一直做；保持某种状态；透过…来看；从…的角度来做；对整体进行；覆盖全部；贯穿整个；从头到尾不间断地做；一次做完；一口气做；一次性完成；转达；传达；传递信息；让声音传出；（接动词连用形）做到底；坚持做下去；贯彻；做完</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97850\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>訪問者<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうもんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>居間<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He let the visitor into the living room.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠回り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおまわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绕路；迂回路线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193756\">もし<ruby>遠回<rp>(</rp><rt>とおまわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りでなければポストに<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please drop it in the mail if it&#x27;s not out of your way.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">街道；道路；大街；交通；往来；流动；通行；流通；声音传播；声音范围；声誉；好评；人气；理解；领会；清晰度；同样的方式；如同；按照；套；组（用于计数）；种；类；方法（用于计数）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222897\">この<ruby>煙突<rp>(</rp><rt>えんとつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りが<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This chimney has begun to draw badly.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通り掛かる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおりかかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">碰巧经过；恰好路过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214099\">すると、たまたま<ruby>少女<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のおばあちゃんが<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りかかる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Along comes the grandmother and sees her granddaughter.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通り過ぎる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおりすぎる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经过；通过；走过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"160303\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>暗<rp>(</rp><rt>くら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>道<rp>(</rp><rt>みち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I passed over the dark street.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">通る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とおる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">经过；通过；沿着；取道；走（某条路）；运行；运营；开通（交通线路）；进屋；入室；被准许进入；被引进；穿透；刺穿；贯穿；透过；渗透；浸透；遍及；传播；传达（如声音）；远达；转达；转告；被传达（如顾客的订单）；通过；批准；获准；被接受；以...的名义为人所知；被认可为；享有...的声誉；连贯；合理；有逻辑；易懂；讲得通；被理解；表达清楚；看起来像；显得；给人...的印象；笔直；（如木纹）顺直；见多识广；睿智；彻底完成；充分地做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91569\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はベスという<ruby>名<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>とお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She went by the name of Bess.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">都会</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">都市；城市；东京都议会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230690\">あの<ruby>人達<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>都会<rp>(</rp><rt>とかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあこがれている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They are longing for city life.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">兎角</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">做这做那；干各种各样的事；容易；倾向于；易于；无论如何；反正；总之；各种（负面的事物）；形形色色的；不存在的东西；兔角</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230774\">あの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはとかくのうわさがあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There were some unsavory rumors about him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶かす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">熔化；液化；解冻；溶解；使溶于液体；赔钱；挥霍；浪费（金钱）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113860\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はコーヒーに<ruby>砂糖<rp>(</rp><rt>さとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>溶<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He dissolved some sugar in his coffee.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">咎める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とがめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">责备；指责；谴责；批评；质问；质疑；盘问；（伤口）恶化；发炎；使伤势加重；刺痛（良心）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141507\"><ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったことを<ruby>咎<rp>(</rp><rt>とが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The teacher blamed her for the mistake.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">尖る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とがる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尖锐；变尖；变锐利；紧张；神经质；易怒；容易发火；尖刻；刺耳；生硬；愤怒；不悦；不满；挑衅；激进；反叛</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219792\">この<ruby>棒<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>先<rp>(</rp><rt>さき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がとがっている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This pole is sharp at the end.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">时间；时刻；时候；场合；情况；机会；时机；季节；时代；时局；年代；时态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79711\"><ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はたいていの<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>寝<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Night is when most people go to bed.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時折</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ときおり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">有时；间或；偶尔；不时</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105270\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>時折<rp>(</rp><rt>ときおり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>腕時計<rp>(</rp><rt>うでどけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をちらりと<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He glanced at his wristwatch now and then.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">時々</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ときどき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">有时</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../n5/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">時</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">跡切れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とぎれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">中断；结束；被打断；被打短；暂停</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"174163\"><ruby>交通<rp>(</rp><rt>こうつう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れにはとぎれがなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There was no gap in the stream of traffic.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">溶く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">混合；溶解；混入；打散；搅拌；搅匀；熔化；液化；冶炼；解冻；熔合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">解开；松开；打开；拆开；解绑；拆包；拆线；拆缝；解答；求解；回答；消除（误会等）；澄清；解除（怀疑）；安抚；解除（合同）；取消；撤销（禁令）；解除（禁令）；解围；免除（职务）；解除；免职；梳理；梳通；解开（缠结的头发）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104339\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>重責<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>解<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He was relieved of his heavy responsibility.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">説く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">解释；宣讲；倡导；劝说；说服；劝导；敦促</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"95842\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>説<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きさとして<ruby>非<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>認<rp>(</rp><rt>みと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I convinced him of his fault.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">得意</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">とくい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">满足；自豪；得意；欣喜；专长；特长；擅长的领域；老顾客；常客；主顾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231810\">あなたは<ruby>数学<rp>(</rp><rt>すうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>得意<rp>(</rp><rt>とくい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Are you good at mathematics?</span></div></li>"]